45", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1436868231844750"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1278478724173176"}]}, "change_log": "No more remeshing while you sculpt: the layer you\u2019re working on is drawn at full detail again, because I took out the lower-detail meshing you saw.\r\nSaving is back to full speed: I undid the change that made saves slower.\r\nSaves on big sculpts no longer freeze the headset: the sculpt is now read back in small pieces instead of one big grab.\r\nStill in from the last two builds: layers you aren\u2019t sculpting are simplified, and Smooth and Move skip the parts they can\u2019t change.", "created_date": 1793251295, "id": "1435138465351060", "version": "0.2.324", "version_code": 324, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1345650624299845", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1436868231844750"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1278478724173176"}]}, "change_log": "Camera videos are much smoother: steady 30 fps at 1080p, without slowing your sculpting.\r\nA simpler Camera menu, like Medium\u2019s: viewfinder, Video or Timelapse, Hand / Head / World, one zoom slider, five backdrop colours and the video\u2019s shape.\r\nThe Room backdrop is gone (the headset\u2019s passthrough can\u2019t be recorded); pick green, blue, pink, black or white.", "created_date": 1793200135, "id": "1434594178738822", "version": "0.2.319", "version_code": 319, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}